#. module: qing_system_update
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_qing_system_update
msgid ""
"\n"
"Shows the installed and latest QingERP Community release in General Settings\n"
"and lets administrators request an upgrade.\n"
"\n"
"The web client only writes an upgrade request for the official latest\n"
"release. The QingERP updater on the host (installed by the one-line\n"
"installer) verifies the release, backs up the database and attachments,\n"
"upgrades the database, restarts QingERP and rolls back on failure.\n"
"Installations without that updater (SaaS, source installs) show that\n"
"upgrades are managed elsewhere.\n"
msgstr ""

